+# Audit: seamless fabrics (0.21.1)
+
+Date: 2026-11-03 · PR: Cochilo 0.26.0 · Auditor: Claude (graphic-design-fundamentals + impeccable)
+
+## Scope
+
+The eleven Tatá Slings texture tiles, remade as true repeating tiles; drawn with a repeat, not
+a mirror. No tokens, no rules change ("No text on a texture" still holds).
+
+## graphic-design-fundamentals (§13 checklist)
+
+| # | Question | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Brief | Pass: her fabrics look like cloth, not a kaleidoscope |
+| 2 | Concept | Pass: a repeat, like a bolt of fabric |
+| 3 | Hierarchy | Pass: the band stays background |
+| 4 | Contrast | Pass: no text on it; light flattened, so no darker blocks |
+| 5 | Alignment and grid | Pass: the 384 px tile on a 2×3 repeat shows no seam |
+| 6 | Spacing | Pass |
+| 7 | Typography | Pass: none on it |
+| 8 | Colour | Pass: each fabric keeps its mean colour (flattening keeps the average) |
+| 9 | Consistency | Pass: one script for all eleven |
+| 10 | Simplicity | Pass |
+| 11 | Real-size test | Pass: Cochilo's fabric screenshots |
+| 12 | Accessibility and ergonomics | Pass: decoration only |
+| 13 | Production | Pass: 240 KB together, WebP q78 |
+
+Polish left: the blend band softens a print where it overlaps itself (Tropical's leaves near
+the middle of each edge); acceptable at band size.
+
+## impeccable (audit)
+
+| # | Dimension | Score | Key finding |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Accessibility | 4 | Decoration only |
+| 2 | Performance | 4 | Smaller files |
+| 3 | Appearance & theming | 4 | No mirror symmetry on prints |
+| 4 | Platform conformance | 4 | — |
+| 5 | Adaptivity | 4 | Repeats on any width (tablet panes) |
+| | **Total** | **20/20** | |
